# Frontend React

- TypeScript strict mode; API calls go through `src/api/client.ts`.
- No CSS framework — use plain CSS and custom properties in `App.css`.
- Pages live in `src/pages/`; shared UI in `src/components/`.
- Vite dev server proxies `/api` to `http://localhost:8000`.
